# Every privilege a request role (public, anon, authenticated, service_role, authenticator) holds on v2's schemas,
# tables, columns, functions and types, and the migration role's default privileges (A8). Written by
# `node scripts/db/test.mjs --write-grants` on a database built from zero; GRANTS-01 compares the live catalog with
# it. A change here is deliberate and its PR says why.
